4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ybOy_MMldOwQ7kNvwG1V3ci&_nc_oc=AdoDKd3zCGeyIPyE1bhcxDJ_0sDvy84DBpY88vj5NuHYqo0Xw87yDa1_8iDdqjyCSNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM8Y_PeAKcTjuPfGF6MErCor0TLfQ-pKSBK6KtfsaxiCw&oe=6AC3D894"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8sj4GR8XtGoQ7kNvwHkwlYj&_nc_oc=AdoDXqHjwENO47K6D3_TnUbciSAV7x9ZR8w2NfWqkyh3I9JNw4uEGj055W1KRtV_Q0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN23S5XE3ia1jpOJKkO4PCcQJmAWT-1e4C1rvGmgWI97Q&oe=6AC3A532"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6xG2sR6xScUQ7kNvwG0nmHB&_nc_oc=AdqpRzSKZ89wKnFfenkCDyJ2rIhaazYeM4IqMNIRWRyhIjOQFXaifEp8U4u1X8aloJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP6GqLEHTQGTFHUUERKeKJAekVXvYC7gXXI4vo4VvbGxA&oe=6AC3B2D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p